{"id":"664159","name":"紫薯糯米丸","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/664159/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"50g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"25g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米提前泡一晚上（放冰箱）。","img":"images/664159/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫薯去皮蒸熟，捣成泥。","img":"images/664159/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"趁热加入白糖，牛奶，糯米粉，揉成团。","img":"images/664159/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一小块，揉成小丸子。","img":"images/664159/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"均匀的滚上沥干水的糯米，用手压实。","img":"images/664159/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将做好的丸子放入蒸锅，水开蒸20分钟。","img":"images/664159/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"紫薯糯米丸。","img":"images/664159/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}